cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or replication archive, please cite the paper below."
title: "adaptsimex: Adaptive SIMEX for Poisson Regression with Classical Measurement Error"
abstract: >-
  Replication archive and R package for Adaptive SIMEX (A-SIMEX), which corrects
  classical covariate measurement error in Poisson regression via
  simulation-extrapolation with cross-validated hyperparameters, a two-stage
  ridge extrapolation, and an analytic sandwich variance estimator.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rkmishra1/A-SIMEX"
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
